    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The decoding of an App Clip Code URL fails under these circumstances:",
      "ko": "다음 상황에서 App Clip Code URL의 디코딩이 실패합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "16aba3508ba23bc81eace6921fd46ca890df271b9f1be66c050e7ee8d9fb24bd",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "The full app or App Clip is missing the associated-domains entitlement from its code signature.",
      "ko": "전체 앱 또는 App Clip의 코드 서명에 associated-domains 엔타이틀먼트가 없습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f51fa479bd74c3eee5e449f57c4eff2b189e436b8d262f1d393decedf702b0af",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "The host of the resource identified by the App Clip Code URL doesn’t vend an Apple App Site Association (AASA) file.",
      "ko": "App Clip Code URL이 식별한 리소스의 호스트에서 Apple App Site Association(AASA) 파일을 제공하지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "27db3ce08156863c7567a115e5d1a1e5d3825d3e5b114977fc62a395fb9fca5d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0003",
      "source": "The AASA file hosted at the App Clip Code URL’s domain lacks the App Clip’s fully-qualified application identifier.",
      "ko": "App Clip Code URL의 도메인에서 호스팅되는 AASA 파일에 App Clip의 fully-qualified application identifier가 없습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "13db2701d28670d1584d3250d976f753ebc3ba13747f030b3a72c9c1e94eb41f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0004",
      "source": "The App Clip Code is not associated to the App Clip in an App Clip experience in App Store Connect.",
      "ko": "App Clip Code는 App Store Connect의 App Clip 경험에서 App Clip과 연결되어 있지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f953e0e257069ced730f4c69c871c422cf970356ee5ab2f53de30a87f36baf78",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "For more information, see [`Configuring App Clip experiences`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip/configuring-the-launch-experience-of-your-app-clip).",
      "ko": "자세한 내용은 [`Configuring App Clip experiences`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip/configuring-the-launch-experience-of-your-app-clip)를 참조합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6b391403c09ed9719a550150a864f6bb930cf0cda86013d746c1689d175e302b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
